@startuml
actor User
participant "词云程序" as Program
participant "数据文件" as DataFile
participant "背景图片" as ImageFile
participant "词云结果" as WordCloud

User -> Program: 运行程序
Program -> DataFile: 读取 CSV 数据
Program -> Program: 进行分词 (jieba.cut)
Program -> Program: 过滤停用词
Program -> ImageFile: 读取背景图片
Program -> WordCloud: 生成词云
Program -> WordCloud: 保存词云图片
User -> WordCloud: 查看生成的词云
@enduml